{
  "id": "flexibility-services",
  "title": "Smart Flexibility in Colchester",
  "summary": "Discover how EV smart charging and Vehicle-to-Grid technology are helping avoid millions in network reinforcement costs.",
  "duration": "7 min",
  "thumbnail": "/data/tours/thumbnails/flexibility.svg",
  "category": "Flexibility Services",
  "chapters": [
    {
      "id": "introduction",
      "title": "The Challenge of Peak Demand",
      "narrative": "Every evening between 5pm and 8pm, electricity demand surges as people return home, cook dinner, and charge their electric vehicles. On Greenstead Road in Colchester, a residential area with high EV uptake, this evening peak is pushing the local distribution transformer to its limits. Without intervention, an expensive upgrade would be needed.",
