        "easing": "fly"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-problem",
      "title": "When EVs Overload the Grid",
      "narrative": "This 500kVA transformer serves 180 homes. With 35 EVs now on the street - and more arriving monthly - simultaneous charging could demand 250kW. Combined with evening cooking, heating, and appliances, peak demand can exceed the transformer's safe capacity. The traditional solution? Replace the transformer and upgrade the cables. Cost: 120,000 pounds.",
