    {
      "id": "economics",
      "title": "The Business Case",
      "narrative": "The numbers tell the story. Traditional reinforcement: 120,000 pounds capital cost, 18-month delivery. Flexibility alternative: 8,000 pounds per year for smart charging contracts, 15,000 pounds per year for V2G services. Over 5 years, flexibility costs 115,000 pounds versus 120,000 pounds for reinforcement - but can be deployed in months, not years. And it scales with the problem.",
      "mapState": {
