    {
      "id": "customer-experience",
      "title": "What It Means for Residents",
      "narrative": "For EV owners, flexibility is a win-win. Smart charging customers receive annual payments of 50-100 pounds for allowing their charge times to shift. V2G participants earn up to 400 pounds per year. Most drivers see no impact on their daily routine - they set their departure time, and the system handles the rest. Cars are fully charged when needed.",
