      "id": "scaling-up",
      "title": "From Street to Region",
      "narrative": "Greenstead Road is just one example. Across the network, similar constraints exist on hundreds of transformers. If flexibility can defer or avoid reinforcement at each, the cumulative savings are substantial. In ED3, the network operator plans to procure 500MW of flexibility services - equivalent to avoiding 200 million pounds in conventional reinforcement.",
